  "metadata": {
    "name": "peard_amm",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "PEARD ASSETS: a bonding curve that will quote against a mint no other venue accepts"
  },
  "docs": [
    "A bonding curve for the mints no other venue will quote against.",
    "",
    "peard owns denomination and settlement and owns no pool. This is the",
    "pool, and the two are joined by nothing but an address: a pool's",
    "`fee_claimer` points at a market's reward vault, fees land there, and",
    "`sweep_fees` on the other side credits whatever turned up. No CPI in",
    "either direction, so either program can be replaced without the other",
    "noticing."
  ],
