    {
      "name": "Pool",
      "docs": [
        "A constant-product curve with a virtual quote reserve.",
        "",
        "The reason this program exists is one line in Meteora's DBC:",
        "`is_supported_quote_mint` waves through any classic SPL mint but accepts",
        "a Token-2022 mint only when `MetadataPointer` and `TokenMetadata` are its",
        "sole extensions. Every xStock and every tokenised metal carries a",
        "permanent delegate and more besides, so DBC will not quote a single one",
        "of them. This will.",
        "",
        "The curve itself is deliberately ordinary. What is not ordinary is that",
        "it assumes the quote mint's issuer retains power over the tokens sitting",
        "in its own vault, because on these assets that is simply true."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "base_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "quote_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "creator",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "fee_claimer",
            "docs": [
              "Where quote fees are claimable to.",
              "",
              "Arbitrary by design and immutable once set: pointing it at a peard",
              "market's reward vault is the entire integration between the two",
              "programs, and it needs no CPI in either direction. Immutable because a",
              "mutable fee route is a rug with extra steps."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "base_reserve",
            "docs": [
              "Base tokens still on the curve. Stored rather than measured, so a",
              "stranger transferring tokens in cannot move the price."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "quote_reserve",
            "docs": [
              "Real quote tokens on the curve, excluding accrued fees."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "virtual_quote",
            "docs": [
              "The virtual leg. Sets the opening price at `virtual_quote /",
              "base_reserve` and lets the pool launch one-sided, with no quote",
              "liquidity from the creator at all."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "fees_quote",
            "docs": [
              "Quote fees taken and not yet claimed. Sits in the quote vault, which",
              "is why the vault's balance is `quote_reserve + fees_quote`."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "fees_quote_lifetime",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "volume_quote_lifetime",
            "type": "u128"
          },
          {
            "name": "swaps",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "shortfall_quote_lifetime",
            "docs": [
              "Quote base units this pool has been short of what it booked.",
              "",
              "Not a rounding counter. `permanentDelegate` lets the issuer move",
              "tokens out of this vault at will, and this records how much of that",
              "has happened. A pool with a non-zero figure here has been reached",
              "into, and the number belongs in front of anyone about to trade on it."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "shortfall_base_lifetime",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "fee_bps",
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "base_decimals",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "quote_decimals",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "backing_reserve",
            "docs": [
              "The peard_vault reserve whose receipt this pool's quote leg IS, or",
              "default for a pool with nothing behind it.",
              "",
              "ON THE POOL RATHER THAN ALONGSIDE IT, on purpose. Anyone reading this",
              "account should be able to see what stands behind the thing they are",
              "about to buy, without knowing that a second program exists or which",
              "account in it to look up. A backing you have to be told about is a",
              "backing most people will never check.",
              "",
              "It is a FACT rather than a claim: `attach_backing` reads the reserve",
              "by hand and refuses unless that reserve's own `receipt_mint` is this",
              "pool's quote mint. A pool cannot point at a warehouse that does not",
              "issue the token it trades.",
              "",
              "Immutable once set, for the same reason `fee_claimer` is: a backing",
              "somebody can repoint is a story rather than a guarantee."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
